<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Members</title>
<style>
body {
  font-family: sans-serif;
  background: #0f172a;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
}
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 50px;
}
.card {
  background: #1e293b;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  width: 200px;
  transition: 0.3s;
}
.card:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
img {
  width: 100px;
  border-radius: 50%;
}
a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: white;
}
button {
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding: 8px 15px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #3b82f6;
  color: white;
  cursor: pointer;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>👥 Member List</h1>

<div class="container">

  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=1">
    <h3>A</h3>
    <p>นักเรียนสายโค้ด</p>
    <a href="user-a.html"><button>ดูโปรไฟล์</button></a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=2">
    <h3>B</h3>
    <p>สายเกม</p>
    <a href="user-b.html"><button>ดูโปรไฟล์</button></a>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html> 

